extends layout

block content
  section.dd-page-hero
    h1 Our Story
    p.dd-page-hero-subtitle
      | A family recipe, a tiny downtown storefront, and a whole lot of early mornings.

  section.dd-section.dd-section--split.dd-section--reverse
    div.dd-section-content
      h2 From 1992 to Today
      p
        | Downtown Donuts began as a weekend pop-up, selling simple glazed donuts and drip coffee
        | to morning commuters. Word spread quickly, and by the end of the year, we had a permanent
        | home in the heart of downtown.
      p
        | Today, we still hand-roll every batch, brew coffee from locally roasted beans, and greet
        | our regulars by name. Some of our guests have been with us for decades—bringing their
        | kids, and now their grandkids, in for a treat.
      p
        | This website is designed to be an online front door: simple, warm, and focused on what
        | matters most—great donuts, great coffee, great people.
    div.dd-section-visual
      div.dd-story-card
        h3 Built for the Neighborhood
        ul.dd-timeline
          li
            span.dd-timeline-year 1992
            span.dd-timeline-text Doors open · first batch sold out by 10 AM.
          li
            span.dd-timeline-year 2005
            span.dd-timeline-text Added locally roasted espresso drinks.
          li
            span.dd-timeline-year 2018
            span.dd-timeline-text Introduced seasonal donut flights.
          li
            span.dd-timeline-year 2025
            span.dd-timeline-text Launched an updated digital presence.

  section.dd-section
    div.dd-section-header
      h2 What We Value
    div.dd-values-grid
      article.dd-value-card
        h3 Warmth
        p
          | We greet every guest like a neighbor and believe donuts taste better with a smile.
      article.dd-value-card
        h3 Craft
        p
          | Small batches, real ingredients, and a little bit of artistry in every glaze.
      article.dd-value-card
        h3 Community
        p
          | We partner with nearby schools, nonprofits, and small businesses whenever we can.

  section.dd-section
    div.dd-section-header
      h2 Visit Downtown Donuts
      p.dd-section-subtitle
        | Come say hello in person. We’d love to pour you a cup.
    div.dd-map-card
      div.dd-map-embed
        // Placeholder map – you could embed a real map here
        p.dd-muted Map placeholder · 123 Main Street, Downtown
      div.dd-map-details
        h3 Hours
        ul
          li Mon – Fri · 6:00 AM – 3:00 PM
          li Sat – Sun · 7:00 AM – 2:00 PM
        h3 Parking
        p Street parking + nearby garage. Bike racks out front.
